  <item>
    <title>The kindness of strangers</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/the_kindness_of_strangers</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve had so many kind people already. We stopped to ask a lady named Benita who we&#039;d ask about camping in the soccer field at Tepehuache - and she took us into the village and found the right people to ask and took us to the soccer field! &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The next day, when we got to the village of Manzanillas, a boy named Manuel immediately asked us if we wanted him to escort us to the plaza. Later, he took me to a bike mechanic (who jammed my pedal into the stripped crank so it will probably stay for awhile) and took us to a hotel where we could get a shower. He was great!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
