  <item>
    <title>First night of camping</title>
    <link>https://hobobiker-prep.ddev.site/first_night_of_camping</link>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;We ended our day in Mazamitla camping in a horse pasture with horses grazing&lt;br /&gt;
around us. As we ate our rice and vegetables for dinner watching the sun change the colors of the sky and the live music from the village festival drift past us, I knew we were in the heart of Mexico where people work hard and enjoy what life has to offer.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
